<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:02.639" end="00:00:05.639" style="s2">USA.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.320" end="00:00:20.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. Thank you. And God bless each</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.880" end="00:00:24.680" style="s2">and every one of you. And God bless the</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.720" end="00:00:24.680" style="s2">United States of America.</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.359" end="00:00:32.599" style="s2">I see.</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.640" end="00:00:42.559" style="s2">I see trouble on the way.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.000" end="00:00:45.559" style="s2">I see</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.559" end="00:00:45.559" style="s2">lightning.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.120" end="00:01:00.680" style="s2">Please welcome the Speaker of the</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.760" end="00:01:00.680" style="s2">Michigan House, Matt Hall.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.119" end="00:01:15.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First things first, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.880" end="00:01:15.320" style="s2">headd up.</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.640" end="00:01:23.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Well, great. Well, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.520" end="00:01:28.439" style="s2">excited to be here today with President</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.840" end="00:01:28.439" style="s2">Donald J. Trump. What about you?</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.880" end="00:01:35.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now, I&#39;ve worked closely with President</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.880" end="00:01:38.079" style="s2">Trump on Michigan&#39;s biggest issues, and</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.600" end="00:01:41.200" style="s2">I&#39;ve seen firsthand how hard he fights</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.079" end="00:01:44.240" style="s2">for our state. President Trump has done</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.200" end="00:01:46.960" style="s2">something politicians have talked about</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.240" end="00:01:49.119" style="s2">for decades, but never delivered, and</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.960" end="00:01:52.000" style="s2">that is lowering our prescription drug</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.119" end="00:01:55.000" style="s2">prices. the biggest drop in more than 60</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.000" end="00:01:55.000" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.159" end="00:02:03.439" style="s2">President Trump forced drug companies to</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.479" end="00:02:06.479" style="s2">give Americans the same low prices they</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.439" end="00:02:08.959" style="s2">give other countries. Trump RX has</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.479" end="00:02:13.599" style="s2">already saved families almost a billion</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.959" end="00:02:17.000" style="s2">dollars with some drugs cut 50%, 70% or</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.599" end="00:02:17.000" style="s2">even 90%.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.800" end="00:02:26.800" style="s2">Now, every Medicaid program, every state</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.920" end="00:02:30.879" style="s2">Medicaid program in America is getting</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.800" end="00:02:34.319" style="s2">those lower prices nearly $65 billion</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.879" end="00:02:37.040" style="s2">over the next decade. And I can tell you</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.319" end="00:02:40.720" style="s2">even our Democrat governor signed up for</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.040" end="00:02:42.640" style="s2">it for our state medicaid program. It</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.720" end="00:02:45.760" style="s2">was too good of a deal for her to pass</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.640" end="00:02:48.319" style="s2">up. And that&#39;s the art of the deal. Here</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.760" end="00:02:50.720" style="s2">in Michigan, we&#39;re pairing those savings</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.319" end="00:02:53.280" style="s2">with reforms to make Medicaid stronger</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.720" end="00:02:56.239" style="s2">and sustainable. We&#39;re cutting waste,</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.280" end="00:02:58.800" style="s2">fraud, and abuse, kicking fraudsters and</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.239" end="00:03:02.200" style="s2">illegal aliens off of Medicaid, and</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.800" end="00:03:02.200" style="s2">making sure</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.879" end="00:03:11.840" style="s2">and making sure Medicaid is there for</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.120" end="00:03:15.200" style="s2">families who truly need it, not</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.840" end="00:03:16.879" style="s2">able-bodied adults, 40-year-old men</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.200" end="00:03:19.680" style="s2">sitting in their parents&#39; basement</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.879" end="00:03:22.840" style="s2">playing video games while taxpayers foot</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.680" end="00:03:22.840" style="s2">the bill.</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.159" end="00:03:31.280" style="s2">That&#39;s why President Trump brought back</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.319" end="00:03:33.840" style="s2">work requirements. If able-bodied adults</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.280" end="00:03:36.159" style="s2">want taxpayer funded health care, they</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.840" end="00:03:38.319" style="s2">should be working, studying, training,</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.159" end="00:03:41.720" style="s2">or serving their community. That is</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.319" end="00:03:41.720" style="s2">common sense.</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.319" end="00:03:49.680" style="s2">But federal reforms only work if states</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.879" end="00:03:52.239" style="s2">carry them out. That&#39;s why at the state</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.680" end="00:03:54.959" style="s2">level, Michigan House Republicans put</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.239" end="00:03:56.959" style="s2">resources and real accountability into</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.959" end="00:03:59.920" style="s2">state law to implement the work</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.959" end="00:04:01.519" style="s2">requirements, verify eligibility, and</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.920" end="00:04:04.640" style="s2">make them work as President Trump</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.519" end="00:04:06.959" style="s2">intended. We&#39;re also auditing autism</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.640" end="00:04:09.680" style="s2">providers and measuring child care</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.959" end="00:04:12.640" style="s2">attendance so taxpayers pay only for</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.680" end="00:04:16.920" style="s2">real services. Minnesota style fraud</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.640" end="00:04:16.920" style="s2">will not happen here in Michigan.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.440" end="00:04:27.120" style="s2">President Trump is also investing $50</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.320" end="00:04:30.160" style="s2">billion to strengthen rural hospitals</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.120" end="00:04:34.080" style="s2">and rural healthcare. In Michigan, we</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.160" end="00:04:36.240" style="s2">received $173 million in year one and</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.080" end="00:04:39.040" style="s2">your state house Republicans are making</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.240" end="00:04:41.360" style="s2">sure it supports local hospitals, more</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.040" end="00:04:44.160" style="s2">doctors and nurses, and better care</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.360" end="00:04:48.680" style="s2">closer to home. That is President Trump</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.160" end="00:04:48.680" style="s2">delivering for Michigan. Again,</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.240" end="00:04:56.960" style="s2">President Trump&#39;s great healthc care</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.160" end="00:04:59.360" style="s2">plan puts patients first with more</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.960" end="00:05:02.000" style="s2">transparency and an end to government</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.360" end="00:05:04.160" style="s2">payoffs for big insurance companies. And</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.000" end="00:05:07.039" style="s2">we&#39;re bringing that same patient first</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.160" end="00:05:10.240" style="s2">approach to lancing. clear prices before</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.039" end="00:05:12.400" style="s2">treatment, ending hidden facility fees,</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.240" end="00:05:15.039" style="s2">and banned banning predatory medical</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.400" end="00:05:17.360" style="s2">debt practices. I&#39;m taking on the</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.039" end="00:05:20.240" style="s2">hospital and insurance lobbies who&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.360" end="00:05:25.000" style="s2">driven up costs higher for years. I</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.240" end="00:05:25.000" style="s2">don&#39;t work for them, I work for you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.360" end="00:05:31.600" style="s2">And that&#39;s why President Trump needs</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.280" end="00:05:34.400" style="s2">strong allies in Michigan to keep these</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.600" end="00:05:36.320" style="s2">reforms moving. Now, here locally,</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.400" end="00:05:39.039" style="s2">you&#39;ve got a great state representative</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.320" end="00:05:42.360" style="s2">and Joe Pavlov who&#39;s doing a great job</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.039" end="00:05:42.360" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.479" end="00:05:46.720" style="s2">And I see Jay Deoer here who&#39;s done a</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.880" end="00:05:49.720" style="s2">fantastic job, our next lieutenant</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.720" end="00:05:49.720" style="s2">governor.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.840" end="00:05:54.639" style="s2">Uh but also in the state senate, you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.080" end="00:05:57.360" style="s2">got Andrew Beer, uh who&#39;s a fighter for</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.639" end="00:06:00.320" style="s2">you, and John Goldwater, who&#39;s going to</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.360" end="00:06:02.320" style="s2">flip a Democrat seat red and deliver a</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.320" end="00:06:05.320" style="s2">Senate Republican majority here in</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.320" end="00:06:05.320" style="s2">Michigan.</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.440" end="00:06:12.800" style="s2">With Republican majorities, we can pass</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.160" end="00:06:16.160" style="s2">my plan to eliminate the state property</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.800" end="00:06:19.400" style="s2">tax, saving the average homeowner $1,000</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.160" end="00:06:19.400" style="s2">a year.</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.280" end="00:06:26.160" style="s2">We can repeal Democrat green energy</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.680" end="00:06:28.319" style="s2">mandates and force utilities to roll</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.160" end="00:06:30.400" style="s2">back their rates a billion dollars,</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.319" end="00:06:33.400" style="s2">wiping out the last three years of rate</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.400" end="00:06:33.400" style="s2">increases.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.000" end="00:06:38.639" style="s2">And we can break the grip of the health</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.080" end="00:06:41.520" style="s2">care lobbyists and dramatically lower</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.639" end="00:06:43.759" style="s2">health care costs for Michigan families.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.520" end="00:06:46.479" style="s2">Now, President Trump has delivered for</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.759" end="00:06:49.039" style="s2">us time and time again. We&#39;ve seen it at</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.479" end="00:06:51.280" style="s2">Selfridge Air National Guard Base. We&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.039" end="00:06:54.880" style="s2">seen it with the tax cuts, the biggest</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.280" end="00:06:57.199" style="s2">in in history, better trade deals, and</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.880" end="00:07:00.319" style="s2">lower prescription drug costs. But</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.199" end="00:07:03.199" style="s2">President Trump cannot do this alone. We</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.319" end="00:07:06.240" style="s2">have to do our part. We have to turn out</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.199" end="00:07:10.000" style="s2">in record numbers and vote. Don&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.240" end="00:07:12.800" style="s2">fake polls trick you from the fake news.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.000" end="00:07:15.199" style="s2">They are trying to suppress our vote.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.800" end="00:07:18.240" style="s2">That is what they want. ignore the fake</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.199" end="00:07:20.880" style="s2">polls and get out and vote. We need to</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.240" end="00:07:26.360" style="s2">swamp the vote for Republicans in every</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.880" end="00:07:26.360" style="s2">single race and make it too big to rig.</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.880" end="00:07:30.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.160" end="00:07:43.639" style="s2">All the words.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.800" end="00:08:01.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please welcome the Republican nominee</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.360" end="00:08:05.960" style="s2">for Michigan&#39;s 10th Congressional</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.440" end="00:08:05.960" style="s2">District, Mike Bousard.</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.319" end="00:08:22.120" style="s2">Sun coming up.</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.720" end="00:08:29.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Holy cow, look at this crowd. Are you</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.639" end="00:08:32.000" style="s2">guys fired up?</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.680" end="00:08:35.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you fired up to fight for the future</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.000" end="00:08:35.560" style="s2">of our country?</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.880" end="00:08:40.080" style="s2">You know, this time last year, I had</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.640" end="00:08:42.479" style="s2">just gotten back from a combat</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.080" end="00:08:43.839" style="s2">deployment to Iraq. And the very next</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.479" end="00:08:46.240" style="s2">day, I started running for this</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.839" end="00:08:48.880" style="s2">congressional seat because the seat I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.240" end="00:08:50.800" style="s2">running for, my district, the Michigan</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.880" end="00:08:54.080" style="s2">10th Congressional District, needs a</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.800" end="00:08:57.120" style="s2">fighter. Our country needs fighters. And</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.080" end="00:08:59.600" style="s2">if we lose this seat, we are likely to</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.120" end="00:09:02.600" style="s2">lose the House to these radical extreme</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.600" end="00:09:02.600" style="s2">leftists.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.440" end="00:09:11.279" style="s2">Now, if Hakeem Jeff is in the majority,</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.880" end="00:09:13.519" style="s2">he will listen and bow to whatever</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.279" end="00:09:16.399" style="s2">demands the Democrat socialists throw at</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.519" end="00:09:21.399" style="s2">him. And my opponent, Christina Hines,</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.399" end="00:09:21.399" style="s2">would be a liberal rubber stamp vote.</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.440" end="00:09:28.800" style="s2">You know, some Democrats might pretend</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.120" end="00:09:31.040" style="s2">to be moderates, but they will always</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.800" end="00:09:33.600" style="s2">vote in lock step with their party&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.040" end="00:09:36.000" style="s2">agenda. If there&#39;s a vote to let men</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.600" end="00:09:39.480" style="s2">into women&#39;s locker rooms, my opponent&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.000" end="00:09:39.480" style="s2">going to vote for it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.839" end="00:09:44.959" style="s2">If there&#39;s a vote to impeach the</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.279" end="00:09:48.120" style="s2">president, my opponent&#39;s going to vote</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.959" end="00:09:48.120" style="s2">for it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.120" end="00:09:52.320" style="s2">And if there&#39;s a vote to open the</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.560" end="00:09:55.720" style="s2">southern border, my opponent is going to</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.320" end="00:09:55.720" style="s2">vote for it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.920" end="00:09:59.120" style="s2">She has already said that she believes</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.519" end="00:10:02.720" style="s2">every single person in this country</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.120" end="00:10:05.680" style="s2">illegally deserves amnesty.</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.720" end="00:10:08.560" style="s2">and amnesty was the sole tenant she</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.680" end="00:10:10.640" style="s2">followed as a prosecutor.</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.560" end="00:10:12.720" style="s2">She let off a human trafficker. She</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.640" end="00:10:15.120" style="s2">dropped all charges when there was a</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.720" end="00:10:17.200" style="s2">mountain of evidence and that man</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.120" end="00:10:20.000" style="s2">continued trafficking and was arrested</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.200" end="00:10:22.240" style="s2">in my district in Warren, Michigan.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.000" end="00:10:24.079" style="s2">My opponent also agreed to a plea deal</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.240" end="00:10:27.640" style="s2">and gave a man who raped a 12-year-old</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.079" end="00:10:27.640" style="s2">girl probation.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.720" end="00:10:35.440" style="s2">And most recently, she has started</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.480" end="00:10:38.240" style="s2">attacking these victims, the victims who</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.440" end="00:10:41.360" style="s2">called her out for letting her down. And</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.240" end="00:10:43.120" style="s2">her response was to attack that victim.</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.360" end="00:10:45.120" style="s2">Even Christina Hines&#39;s own colleagues</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.120" end="00:10:48.000" style="s2">have said, &quot;Shame on her for attacking</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.120" end="00:10:50.000" style="s2">the victims.&quot; We cannot let people like</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.000" end="00:10:52.000" style="s2">this set the course of our country&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.000" end="00:10:54.480" style="s2">future.</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.000" end="00:10:56.560" style="s2">Now, we need to put America first. We</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.480" end="00:10:58.800" style="s2">need policies that will help the</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.560" end="00:11:01.519" style="s2">hardworking families across my district,</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.800" end="00:11:04.720" style="s2">this state, and this country. We cannot</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.519" end="00:11:06.160" style="s2">allow crazy ideology to govern us. My</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.720" end="00:11:08.480" style="s2">opponent said she is thrilled to work</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.160" end="00:11:12.399" style="s2">with the Jane Fonda Climate Pack. Now,</p>
